@prefix : <http://example.org/family#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/family> a owl:Ontology .

:Person a owl:Class .
:hasParent a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Person ; rdfs:range :Person .
:hasGrandparent a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Person ; rdfs:range :Person ;
    owl:propertyChainAxiom ( :hasParent :hasParent ) .
